# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Internal build-operation files. These are NOT part of the public product and
# must never land in this repo. The exclusion is structural on purpose: if the
# full working tree is ever copied over this one, these stay out by name.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
SPEC.md
DECISIONS.md
data/TAGGING_REPORT.md
site/DEPLOY.md
STAGED_ROUTE.md
HANDOFF*.md
diffs/

# The source markdown the directory is baked FROM lives outside this repo and
# is hand-edited. Only the baked artifact (data/directory.json) is published.
[0-9][0-9]-*.md
tools_recount.py
INDEX.md
SCHEMA.md

# Generator scratch output. site/ already holds the committed build; _dist is a
# throwaway clean copy made at deploy time.
site/_dist/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
.eggs/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors and OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
